title: Rear Camera 'Full View Not Available' Warning Overlay Removal
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Rear Camera 'Full View Not Available' Warning Overlay
  Removal
category: Cameras and ADAS
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Cameras and ADAS] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: Remove "Full
  view not available" message on Sync camera screen while in motion]

  Removes motion warning message overlay on Sync camera screen. Reboot APIM after
  applying.'
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-02-02
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: RCOD HMI w/o Blackbox (RCODHMIB)
      target_state: RCODHMIB Enabled
recipe_version: '1.1'
